Package: vgplotr
Title: An R Interface to Mosaic vgplot
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Randall", "Pruim", , "rpruim@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("UW Interactive Data Lab", role = "cph",
           comment = "Copyright holder of Mosaic (BSD-3-Clause), bundled in inst/htmlwidgets/lib/mosaic-bundle.min.js; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"),
    person("Observable, Inc.", role = "cph",
           comment = "Copyright holder of Observable Plot (ISC), portions embedded within Mosaic; see inst/COPYRIGHTS"))
Description: Provides a piped, tidyverse-flavored R API for building
    declarative 'mosaic' vgplot specifications
    (<https://github.com/uwdata/mosaic>), which can be rendered as
    interactive, database-backed graphics in HTML output (e.g., via
    'htmlwidgets' and Quarto/R Markdown documents).
